{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "dbabda38-be94-5c7b-874c-64bbb1bb758f",
    "name": "Dua Kelinci Sales Dashboard",
    "description": "API of the Dua Kelinci sales dashboard (FastAPI).\n\nStart the app with `./setup.sh` (or `docker compose up -d`). It listens on http://localhost:8000 unless `APP_PORT` is changed in `.env`; change the `baseUrl` collection variable to match.\n\nNo authentication. Running the whole collection in the Collection Runner is safe: the Recipients folder adds two test recipients and deletes them again, and the only Telegram call goes to the placeholder `chatId`. The **Send to Telegram** folder sends real messages; run it by hand.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Status",
      "description": "Health of the app and the Telegram bot setup.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Health",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/health",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "health"
              ]
            },
            "description": "App status and which sales data is loaded.\n\nResponse: `status`, `rows` (cleaned rows in SQLite), `source` (CSV the data was seeded from), `seeded_at` (UTC, set on first setup or the last `./setup.sh reseed`), and `csv_changed_since_seed` (true when `data/sales.csv` was edited after seeding; run `./setup.sh reseed` to load it)."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Status 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test(\"status is ok\", () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().status).to.eql(\"ok\"));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "id": "a8b33a01-f6c8-5298-93f8-4442df79cbb8"
        },
